{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0297","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000001ca:text","row":39546,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"教室には冬子がいる。","en":"Touko was in the classroom.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904253","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00001","en":"Touko was in the classroom.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000001f6:text","row":39547,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"記録に忠実に。","en":"Exactly as the records said.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904254","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00002","en":"Faithfully as recorded.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000021c:text","row":39548,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"きっとこいつには、他に行く場所なんてありはしないんだ。","en":"She probably had nowhere else to go.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904255","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00003","en":"That this gal hasn't got any other place to go other than here, for sure.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","presentation"],"assessment":"The source is a complete assertion. The English begins with a subordinating 'that' and never supplies a governing clause.","remedy":"I'm sure this girl has nowhere else to go.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":73,"start":0,"text":"That this gal hasn't got any other place to go other than here, for sure."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000026a:text","row":39549,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"自宅で一人こもっているほど、強くもない。","en":"And she wasn't strong enough to shut herself away at home alone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904256","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00004","en":"She doesn't have strength enough to seclude herself alone at home.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000002b2:text","row":39550,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「冬子、ちゃんとメシくってる？」","en":"“Touko, are you eating okay?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904257","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00005","en":"Taichi: \"Touko, are you eating meals properly?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000002f2:text","row":39551,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904258","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00006","en":"Touko: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000312:text","row":39552,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"一瞥だけを寄こし、視線を外した。","en":"She glanced at me once, then looked away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904259","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00007","en":"She sends me one lone glance, then moves her sight away.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000034a:text","row":39553,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"ただそれだけの行動に、無数のメッセージがこもっていそうだ。","en":"That tiny gesture seemed loaded with countless messages.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904260","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00008","en":"Yet, that mere behavior seems to seclude a countless number of messages.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the tiny action seems to contain countless messages. 'Seclude' means isolate a person or thing from others and cannot express semantic containment.","remedy":"seems to contain countless messages","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":71,"start":24,"text":"seems to seclude a countless number of messages"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000039c:text","row":39554,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"尻目にかけられている雰囲気は感じない。","en":"There was no contempt in it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904261","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00009","en":"I don't feel the atmosphere that there would be in being looked askance,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000003da:text","row":39555,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"ただ拗ねているだけに見える。","en":"She simply looked sulky.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904262","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00010","en":"she merely appears to be sulking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000416:text","row":39556,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「無視するなよ」","en":"“Don’t ignore me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904263","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00011","en":"Taichi: \"Don'tcha ignore me!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000043e:text","row":39557,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"ほっぺたをつまむ。","en":"I pinched her cheek.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904264","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00012","en":"I pinch her cheeks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000048d:text","row":39558,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「やめてよ！」","en":"“Stop that!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904265","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00013","en":"Touko: \"Stop it!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000004d6:text","row":39559,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"払われる。","en":"She slapped my hand away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904266","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00014","en":"Pushed off.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000500:text","row":39560,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって無視するんだもん」","en":"“But you were ignoring me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904267","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00015","en":"Taichi: \"But yer ignoring me dammit!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000659:text","row":39561,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「察しなさいよ！」","en":"“Take the hint!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904268","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00016","en":"Touko: \"Do guess why.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000683:text","row":39562,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"怒ること。","en":"Anger.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904269","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00017","en":"Anger.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000006a5:text","row":39563,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"それが冬子の、交流への第一歩だと知っていた。","en":"I knew getting angry was Touko's first step toward opening up to someone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904270","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00018","en":"That, I knew, was the very first step towards interchange for Touko.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000006f1:text","row":39564,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「むにっ」","en":"“Squish.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904271","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Boobnyah!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The source is a comic sound accompanying another cheek pinch. The English explicitly invents a breast reference absent from the Japanese and immediate action.","remedy":"Squish!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":18,"start":9,"text":"Boobnyah!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000799:text","row":39565,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「やーめーろー！」","en":"“Stooop it!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904272","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00020","en":"Touko: \"STOP! THIS! NOW!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000007cb:text","row":39566,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「早いね。今日は始業式だけで授業はないよ」","en":"“You're early. It's just the opening ceremony today—no classes.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904273","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00021","en":"Taichi: \"You're early aren't ya. Today's just the opening ceremony, so there's no lessons.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000893:text","row":39567,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「始業式だってないでしょ！」","en":"“There isn't even a ceremony!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904274","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00022","en":"Touko: \"There's no opening ceremony at all!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000008cf:text","row":39568,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「また私服で来るし」","en":"“And you're in casual clothes again.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904275","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00023","en":"Taichi: \"You came in your own clothes again.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000981:text","row":39569,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「この学校の制服なんて着たくないの」","en":"“I don’t want to wear this school’s uniform.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904276","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00024","en":"Touko: \"I really don't want to wear the uniform of this school, no.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000009c5:text","row":39570,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why not?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904277","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00025","en":"Taichi: \"How come?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000a71:text","row":39571,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「バカに見られるでしょお！？」","en":"“It makes me look like an idiot!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904278","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00026","en":"Touko: \"Because I'll look stupid won't I?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000aaf:text","row":39572,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「ひどい言いぐさ」","en":"“That's a horrible thing to say.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904279","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00027","en":"Taichi: \"Nasty remark that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000ad9:text","row":39573,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"誤解だし。","en":"Not to mention wrong.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904280","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00028","en":"It's a misunderstanding.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000b03:text","row":39574,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「ただみんなオツムが普通でないだけだ」","en":"“It's just that nobody here has a normal brain, that's all.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904281","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00029","en":"Taichi: \"It's just that everybody's 'heads' are not normal, 's all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000bc7:text","row":39575,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「そーゆーのを世間は馬鹿にするじゃない！」","en":"“That's exactly what people make fun of!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904282","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00030","en":"Touko: \"And isn't that the reason why the world would see me as stupid!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Touko says society mocks or calls people like that stupid. The English narrows the target to Touko personally and makes the issue how she appears.","remedy":"that's exactly the sort of person society calls stupid","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":70,"start":38,"text":"the world would see me as stupid"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000c11:text","row":39576,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「だから、闘うんだろ」","en":"“That’s why you fight.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904283","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Well then, struggle on!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","logical_relation"],"assessment":"Taichi says that is why she has to fight. The English turns the statement of necessity into a cheer or command to continue.","remedy":"That's why you fight, isn't it?","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":32,"start":9,"text":"Well then, struggle on!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000cc5:text","row":39577,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はあ？」","en":"“...What?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904284","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00032","en":"Touko: \"...huh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000cf3:text","row":39578,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「攻撃から、どうやって身を守るんだよ」","en":"“How else are you supposed to defend yourself when people attack you?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904285","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00033","en":"Taichi: \"When attacks come, how do you defend yourself?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000d39:text","row":39579,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「そいつらと同じように振る舞って、普通に振る舞って、溶けこまないとダメなんだよ」","en":"“You have to act like them. Act normal. Blend in.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904286","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00034","en":"Taichi: \"You behave the same as those guys, you behave normally. Not melting in is not gonna work ya know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000da9:text","row":39580,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「そういう技術がいるんだろ？」","en":"“That takes skill, doesn't it?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904287","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00035","en":"Taichi: \"Aren't those the kind of techniques you need?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000e65:text","row":39581,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「……なに本気の話しちゃってるの？　朝っぱらから」","en":"“...Why are you getting all serious first thing in the morning?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904288","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00036","en":"Touko: \"...what's with you talking all serious now? And this early in the morning.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000f35:text","row":39582,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「……だいたい、他人なんてもういないじゃない。なにしたって無駄なんだから」","en":"“...Besides, there isn't anyone else left. Nothing we do matters.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904289","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00037","en":"Touko: \"...besides there aren't any 'others' anymore. So all you're saying is all pointless anyway.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00000f9f:text","row":39583,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「毎週そうやって何もしないのか？」","en":"“So you're going to sit here doing nothing every week?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904290","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00038","en":"Taichi: \"Are you just going to do nothing like this, every week?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000105f:text","row":39584,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「毎週？」","en":"“Every week?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904291","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00039","en":"Touko: \"Every week?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00001081:text","row":39585,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"失言だ。","en":"I'd let that slip.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904292","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00040","en":"Gaffe.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000010a1:text","row":39586,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"誤魔化さないと。","en":"I had to cover it up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904293","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00041","en":"I must deceive.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000010d1:text","row":39587,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「ですわ言葉のおばさん予備軍」","en":"“That prissy way you talk makes you an old lady in training.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904294","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00042","en":"Taichi: \"Usage of shan't tied to likelihood of being predestined to becoming an old bag.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wordplay","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Taichi mocks her feminine ですわ-style speech as marking her for the ranks of future middle-aged women. The English substitutes the unrelated contraction 'shan't' and becomes grammatically incoherent.","remedy":"You're in the future-old-lady brigade with that 'desu wa' speech.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":88,"start":9,"text":"Usage of shan't tied to likelihood of being predestined to becoming an old bag."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000118d:text","row":39588,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぬぁんですってーっ！？」","en":"“Excu-u-use me?!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904295","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00043","en":"Touko: \"WHAASSS'D YOU SAAAAID?!?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","typography"],"assessment":"The shouted question uses an impossible contraction and the past form 'said' after the auxiliary.","remedy":"WHAAAT DID YOU SAAAAY?!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":32,"start":8,"text":"WHAASSS'D YOU SAAAAID?!?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000011c7:text","row":39589,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「それそれ」","en":"“That. Right there.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904296","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00044","en":"Taichi: \"Like that, liiike that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000011eb:text","row":39590,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"ノートにあった着火のススメに則って、冬子を活気づけるか。","en":"The notebook recommended lighting her fuse. Time to put some life into Touko.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904297","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00045","en":"Can I revitalize Touko by igniting her, as is recommended in the notebooks?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The narrator resolves to enliven Touko by provoking her, following the notebook's recommendation. The English turns that decision into a question about whether he is able to do it.","remedy":"I'll fire Touko up, following the notebook's recommendation.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":22,"start":0,"text":"Can I revitalize Touko"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00001243:text","row":39591,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「今の冬子のオバサン度は９２％だ。平均が２５％だから致命的だな。しかも加齢とともに１％ずつ増えていくから、おまえ三十路のずっと手前で完膚無きまでにオバサン完全体になるな」","en":"“Your old-lady level is already ninety-two percent. The average is twenty-five, so you're terminal. And it rises another point every birthday. You'll reach your final old-lady form well before thirty.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904298","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00046","en":"Taichi: \"Currently your old bag level is 92%, Touko. Being that the average is 25%, it is therefore lethal. Furthermore, as with every year of age accumulated it grows by 1%, you will, before you hit age 30, become thoroughly and perfectly an old bag in body and soul.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000136e:text","row":39592,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“........................”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904299","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00047","en":"Touko: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000139a:text","row":39593,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"秒読み開始。３……２……１……。","en":"Countdown initiated. Three... two... one...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904300","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00048","en":"Countdown begins. 3... 2... 1...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00001458:text","row":39594,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「○×△□＄＃％＆○×△□＄＃％＆ッッッッッ！！」","en":"“@#$%&! @#$%&! Aaaaargh!!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904301","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00049","en":"Touko: \"○×△□＄＃％＆○×△□＄＃％＆!!!!!!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000014a2:text","row":39595,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"燃えた燃えた。","en":"There she went, up in flames.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904302","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00050","en":"She burned, she burned!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000014c8:text","row":39596,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"燃焼力が冬子の生きる力になる。","en":"Touko's combustion would fuel her will to live.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904303","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00051","en":"The strength to combust will be Touko's strength to live.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000014fe:text","row":39597,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"……かどうかはともかく、頑張れ。","en":"...Whether or not that was true, hang in there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904304","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00052","en":"...or maybe it won't, regardless, she'll do her best.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The narrator inwardly tells Touko to hang in there. The English instead predicts that she will do her best.","remedy":"whether that's true or not, hang in there.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":52,"start":34,"text":"she'll do her best"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00001536:text","row":39598,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"内心、エールを贈った。","en":"I cheered her on in silence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904305","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00053","en":"I gave her a shout of cheer in my heart of hearts.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000015ea:text","row":39599,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんとか言えぇぇぇ！」","en":"“Say something, dammit!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904306","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00054","en":"Touko: \"SAY SOMETHIIIING!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00001622:text","row":39600,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「わっ！」","en":"“Whoa!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904307","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00055","en":"Taichi: \"Wah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00001644:text","row":39601,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"攻撃を避けた。","en":"I dodged.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904308","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00056","en":"Dodged an attack.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:0000166a:text","row":39602,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"潮時か。","en":"Time to leave.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904309","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00057","en":"Seems to be the propitious time.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:00001692:text","row":39603,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃーねー」","en":"“See you!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904310","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00058","en":"Taichi: \"Byez nooow!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0297:000017b5:text","row":39604,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ、ま、待ちなさいよっ！」","en":"“Hey! W-wait!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904311","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0008d:00059","en":"Touko: \"Ah, w-, wait up you!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
